OL,3,AZelensky says strikes on Ukraine
OL,4,Ainfrastructure 'Putin's answer' to
OL,5,ATrump on energy ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky says
OL,8,FUkraine is willing to back an energy
OL,9,Fceasefire if Moscow does the same,
OL,10,Fadding it could "become a major step
OL,11,Ftoward ending the war"
OL,13,FIt comes after Donald Trump said in a
OL,14,Fsocial media post on Sunday that such a
OL,15,Ftruce had been reached between Ukraine
OL,16,Fand Russia. "Effective immediately," he
OL,17,Fadded
OL,19,FUkraine's President Zelensky says that
OL,20,F"immediately after" the announcement
OL,21,Ffrom Trump, Russia hit a power plant in
OL,22,FUkraine
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
