OL,3,AZelensky says strikes on Ukraine
OL,4,Ainfrastructure 'Putin's answer' to
OL,5,ATrump on energy ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, Russia's Foreign Minister
OL,8,FSergey Lavrov says Kyiv doesn't deserve
OL,9,Fthe "respite" a ceasefire would bring
OL,11,FEarlier, when asked about an energy
OL,12,Ftruce, a Kremlin spokesman said: "As
OL,13,Fsoon as we have something to say on the
OL,14,Fmatter, we will inform you"
OL,16,FTrump has been urging Ukraine to stop
OL,17,Fstrikes on Russian oil infrastructure
OL,18,Fso Moscow can fulfil a recently struck
OL,19,Fdeal to release diesel to the US and
OL,20,Fthe global market
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
